// %psource NAME and ??NAME / %pinfo2 NAME (IPython's): the source of a name
// the session defined — its whole definition, from the entry that typed it
// or the file %load read — and %pinfo's fields with a Source: section after
// them. A name the session holds no source for (a header's) is refused by
// %psource; ??NAME then shows %pinfo alone.
int base = 10;
